<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Privacy Policy - CoverScore AI</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
  <style>
    .policy-page { background: #f8fafc; min-height: 100vh; }
    .policy-nav { background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 20px 0; }
    .policy-nav-content { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .policy-logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; text-decoration: none; }
    .policy-logo span { color: #3b82f6; }
    .policy-hero { background: #fff; padding: 60px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; text-align: center; }
    .policy-hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .policy-hero p { color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; }
    .policy-content { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 24px; background: #fff; }
    .policy-toc { background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
    .policy-toc h2 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
    .policy-toc ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; }
    .policy-toc a { color: #3b82f6; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; }
    .policy-toc a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .policy-section { margin-bottom: 40px; }
    .policy-section h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
    .policy-section h3 { font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 600; color: #334155; margin: 24px 0 12px; }
    .policy-section p { color: #475569; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 15px; }
    .policy-section ul { color: #475569; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 24px; }
    .policy-section li { margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 15px; }
    .policy-highlight { background: #f0f9ff; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; margin: 24px 0; }
    .policy-highlight p { margin-bottom: 0; color: #1e40af; }
    .last-updated { font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    @media (max-width: 640px) { .policy-toc ul { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .policy-hero h1 { font-size: 1.75rem; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="policy-page">
    <nav class="policy-nav">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="policy-nav-content">
          <a href="/" class="policy-logo">Cover<span>Score</span> AI</a>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center;">
            <a href="/auth/login" style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none;">Sign In</a>
            <a href="/assessment/start" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Get Started</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="policy-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Last updated: March 15, 2026</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="policy-content">
      <div class="policy-toc">
        <h2>Table of Contents</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#information">Information We Collect</a></li>
          <li><a href="#use">How We Use Your Information</a></li>
          <li><a href="#sharing">Information Sharing</a></li>
          <li><a href="#security">Data Security</a></li>
          <li><a href="#rights">Your Rights</a></li>
          <li><a href="#retention">Data Retention</a></li>
          <li><a href="#cookies">Cookies</a></li>
          <li><a href="#children">Children's Privacy</a></li>
          <li><a href="#changes">Changes to This Policy</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contact">Contact Us</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section" id="information">
        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>At CoverScore AI, we collect information to provide better services and deliver AI-powered risk assessment capabilities. The types of information we collect include:</p>
        <h3>1.1 Information You Provide</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> Name, email address, password, phone number when you create an account</li>
          <li><strong>Business Information:</strong> Industry type, number of employees, annual revenue, business location details</li>
          <li><strong>Assessment Data:</strong> Responses to risk assessment questions about your business operations, assets, and insurance needs</li>
          <li><strong>Payment Information:</strong> Credit card details and billing address (processed securely through Stripe)</li>
          <li><strong>Communications:</strong> Any information you provide when contacting support or participating in surveys</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>1.2 Information Collected Automatically</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Pages visited, features used, time spent on the platform</li>
          <li><strong>Device Information:</strong> Browser type, operating system, device identifiers</li>
          <li><strong>Log Data:</strong> IP address, access times, referring URLs</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section" id="use">
        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use the collected information for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Generate AI-powered risk assessments and personalized recommendations</li>
          <li>Create and maintain your account with secure authentication</li>
          <li>Process payments and send billing notifications</li>
          <li>Send you assessment reports and relevant insurance insights</li>
          <li>Improve our AI models and platform functionality</li>
          <li>Provide customer support and respond to inquiries</li>
          <li>Send service updates, security alerts, and administrative messages</li>
          <li>Detect, prevent, and address fraud, security issues, and illegal activities</li>
          <li>Comply with legal obligations and enforce our Terms of Service</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section" id="sharing">
        <h2>3. Information Sharing</h2>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share your information in the following circumstances:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> With trusted third parties who assist in operating our platform (hosting, analytics, payment processing, customer support)</li>
          <li><strong>Business Transfers:</strong> In connection with a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets, your information may be transferred as a business asset</li>
          <li><strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> When required by law, court order, or governmental authority, or when we believe disclosure is necessary to protect our rights or prevent harm</li>
          <li><strong>With Your Consent:</strong> Any other sharing will only occur with your explicit consent</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="policy-highlight">
          <p><strong>Note:</strong> We may share aggregated, anonymized data that cannot identify you with insurance partners, research institutions, or industry groups to advance risk assessment research.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section" id="security">
        <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
        <p>We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your data:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Encryption:</strong> All data is encrypted in transit (TLS 1.3) and at rest (AES-256)</li>
          <li><strong>Access Controls:</strong> Strict access controls with least privilege principles</li>
          <li><strong>Monitoring:</strong> Continuous security monitoring and logging</li>
          <li><strong>Compliance:</strong> SOC 2 Type II certified and GDPR compliant</li>
          <li><strong>Regular Audits:</strong> Third-party security audits and penetration testing</li>
        </ul>
        <p>While we strive to protect your information, no method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure. We cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section" id="rights">
        <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the following rights regarding your personal information:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of the personal information we hold about you</li>
          <li><strong>Correction:</strong> Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete information</li>
          <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> Request deletion of your personal information (subject to legal retention requirements)</li>
          <li><strong>Portability:</strong> Receive your data in a structured, commonly used format</li>
          <li><strong>Objection:</strong> Object to certain processing activities, including direct marketing</li>
          <li><strong>Restriction:</strong> Request restriction of processing in certain circumstances</li>
          <li><strong>Withdraw Consent:</strong> Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@coverscore.ai" style="color: #3b82f6;">privacy@coverscore.ai</a>. We will respond within 30 days.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section" id="retention">
        <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>We retain your personal information for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this policy, unless a longer retention period is required by law. Specifically:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Account Data:</strong> Retained while your account is active and for 3 years after closure</li>
          <li><strong>Assessment Data:</strong> Retained for 5 years after last assessment for historical analysis purposes</li>
          <li><strong>Usage Analytics:</strong> Aggregated and anonymized after 26 months</li>
          <li><strong>Transaction Records:</strong> Retained for 7 years per financial regulatory requirements</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section" id="cookies">
        <h2>7. Cookies</h2>
        <p>We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to operate our platform. For detailed information about our cookie practices, please see our <a href="/cookie-policy" style="color: #3b82f6;">Cookie Policy</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section" id="children">
        <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>Our services are not directed to individuals under 18 years of age. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe we have collected information from a child under 18, please contact us immediately at <a href="mailto:privacy@coverscore.ai" style="color: #3b82f6;">privacy@coverscore.ai</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section" id="changes">
        <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any material changes by:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Posting the updated policy on this page with a new "Last updated" date</li>
          <li>Sending an email notification to the address associated with your account</li>
          <li>Displaying a prominent notice within the platform for 30 days after the change</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Your continued use of our services after changes become effective constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section" id="contact">
        <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:privacy@coverscore.ai" style="color: #3b82f6;">privacy@coverscore.ai</a></li>
          <li><strong>Mail:</strong> CoverScore AI, Inc., Attn: Privacy Team, 123 Insurance Lane, San Francisco, CA 94102</li>
          <li><strong>Phone:</strong> (800) 555-1234</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer style="background: #0f172a; padding: 32px 0;">
      <div class="container">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px;">
